  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bangladesh Natl. Women Lawyers Assoc. 2009-2012   2009/37557</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh Natl. Women Lawyers Assoc. 2009-2012 - BNWLA Making Difference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Targeting six divisions of Bangladesh, total of 30 one-stop legal service delivery centers will function. Disadvantaged and distressed women and children living in poverty will be the primary target group. Govt representatives of different Ministries, local govt reps, police officials, lawyers, journalists, NGO leaders and others relevant stakeholders will be treated as secondary target group.</narrative>
